& [SchemaNode] is a boolean schema or object interpreted at a position licensed by Draft 2020-12 grammar
& [DomainPropertyName] is a name inside properties patternProperties dependentSchemas or dollar defs and is never a keyword at that level
& [SchemaRuleSite] is one root-qualified keyword occurrence at one canonical JSON Pointer
& [CanonicalRuleDefinition] is the normalized content identity of a rule reusable for planning
& [ReferenceClosureEdge] is one local reference-site to target relation without target cloning

& [TypedBindingSite] is one source-bound serde presence representation serialization or deserialization behavior candidate
& [DivergenceCandidate] is a hypothesized schema-typed distinction awaiting actual observation
  + it is neither a finding nor a verified disagreement

& [RootRuleObligation] is one mandatory or advisory coverage target bound to root direction source site kind polarity and boundary
& [ObligationTemplate] is a reusable case-shape suggestion without root execution or satisfaction authority
& [CoverageEdge] belongs to a later case catalogue and is absent from compiler output

& [AssertionRole] can affect schema acceptance under the fixed validator profile
& [ApplicatorRole] controls child-schema evaluation and branch semantics
& [AnnotationRole] records meaning without affecting acceptance under the fixed profile
& [IdentityRole] binds dialect document and source identity

& [RefinedDisposition] is deterministic_nonexecuting_obligation_compiler_formation
